---
description: Repository engineering rules and pull-request gates
alwaysApply: true
---

Follow `AGENTS.md` at the repository root. It is the single rules file.

- Small tasks: about 400 changed lines per pull request.
- Run `bash .github/scripts/local-proof.sh` before asking for review and paste the result.
- Never merge, never commit secrets, never hard-code configuration, never skip a gate.
- Missing requirement or decision: write an open question instead of guessing.
- Docs and `CHANGELOG.md` change in the same pull request as the code.
